msgctxt "PublicContentTextData:3100:0:0"
msgid "<if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, it looks like <player-name $n1> decided to visit!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ご連絡、ご連絡！<br><player-name $n1>さんがいらっしゃいました！
#. de: Wieder<shy>sehen! Wieeedersehen! Sagt alle „Auf Wieder<shy>sehen“ zu <player-name $n1>!
#. fr: Ohé, ohé<nbsp>!  <player-name $n1> a débarqué sur l'île<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <player-name $n1> — the name of a player character; player = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "PublicContentTextData:3101:0:0"
msgid "Guess what, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! <player-name $n1> is here!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ご連絡、ご連絡！<br>建築が終わり、ご確認待ちの建物があります！<br>どうぞ、対象の土地の管理板まで向かわれてください！
#. de: Fertig! Feeertig! Ein Gebäude wurde fertiggestellt und wartet noch auf eine Begutachtung seitens <if $gn4>der Bauherrin<else>des Bauherren</if>!
#. fr: Ohé, ohé<nbsp>!  La con<shy>struc<shy>tion d'une de vos ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions est terminée<nbsp>! Mes collègues n'attendent plus que vous pour inaugurer la nouvelle bâtisse. Allez donc consulter le panneau de con<shy>struc<shy>tion correspondant pour finaliser l'opération.
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "PublicContentTextData:3102:0:0"
msgid "<if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>, a structure has been completed! You need but access the appropriate logboard to give it a final inspection!"
msgstr ""

